{"articleNo":"123003","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=123003&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[현장실습] 동양산업 채용연계형 학기중 현장실습생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.02.11","hit":"2827","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">[2014-1학기]</span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">동양산업(주) 채용연계형 현장실습생 모집</span></font></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 업체명 : 동양산업(주) (구미)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - LG전자 우수협력업체(중견기업)</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>2. 모집분야 및 전공 : 4학년 2학기 이상</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 연구소 현장실습 필요 인력 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>3명</strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 필요 요건: 2D 및 3D 설계(기계), OR-CAD(전자)&nbsp;가능 인력, 인성이 좋은 학생</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 관련 학과: 기계&nbsp;계열, 전자공학</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 향후 수행 업무분야: 제품 개발</span></span></font> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span></span></span></p>&nbsp;<p></p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>3. 현장실습생 채용 관련 진행 절차</span></span></font></p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>1) 서류 전형(학교)</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>2) 기업 실무자 면접</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>3) 현장실습생 선발 / 실습 진행</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>4) 채용 여부 결정 및 취업</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><font face=\"굴림\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>4. 신청 기간 : 2월 23일(월) 15:00시 까지&nbsp;</span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>5. 신청 방법 : 원스톱 서비스에 신청</span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;희망업무란에 동양산업 작성하여 신청</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;-</span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp;이미 신청한 학생 중 동양산업을 희망하는 학생은 센터로 연락바람</font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>6.&nbsp;학점 부여 :&nbsp;</span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">학기중 현장실습 (취업연계)</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span>7.&nbsp;실습비(학교지급) :&nbsp;지급기준에 의거하여 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"+0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font size=\"+0\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">8.&nbsp;문의처 : 현장실습지원센터 (그린에너지관 201호, 478-7891, sml</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"mailto:dy1129@kumoh.ac.kr\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><u>@kumoh.ac.kr</u></font></a></span><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)</span></span></p></span></font></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
